[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17703.67, "timestamp": "04:55:03", "text": "嗯。等待。呃，好的。是的。发电机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17707.67, "timestamp": "04:55:07", "text": "我为什么要把它关掉？好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17711.03, "timestamp": "04:55:11", "text": "对，上次我当时就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17713.59, "timestamp": "04:55:13", "text": "我尝试点击鼠标左键，但没有反应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17715.99, "timestamp": "04:55:15", "text": "在职的。我拿着它。它不起作用。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17717.83, "timestamp": "04:55:17", "text": "不得不这么做，因为你需要继续下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17720.75, "timestamp": "04:55:20", "text": "握住并拉动它。是啊，我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17723.59, "timestamp": "04:55:23", "text": "就像在角落里一样。这就是你当时的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17725.75, "timestamp": "04:55:25", "text": "卡住。门从顶部关上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17728.628, "timestamp": "04:55:28", "text": "哦，是的。我当时就说，宝贝，我打不开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17735.59, "timestamp": "04:55:35", "text": "所以通往外面的门是向外开的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17738.628, "timestamp": "04:55:38", "text": "里面的门是向外开的。暂无营业"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17747.67, "timestamp": "04:55:47", "text": "我的天哪。不停地给他打电话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17750.03, "timestamp": "04:55:50", "text": "好的，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17752.31, "timestamp": "04:55:52", "text": "待办的。你可以检查一下电磁场强度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17754.948, "timestamp": "04:55:54", "text": "读者也是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17757.2, "timestamp": "04:55:57", "text": "待办的。"}]